WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.039 --> 00:00:03.750
("Funky Hornblower" by Warner
/ Chappell Production Music)

00:00:07.319 --> 00:00:08.178
- Alright.

00:00:08.178 --> 00:00:10.858
McDonald's rejects Burger
King's McWhopper stunt.

00:00:10.858 --> 00:00:12.391
What an (bleep).

00:00:12.391 --> 00:00:16.572
- So, Burger King wanted to
be a super nice dude about it

00:00:16.572 --> 00:00:20.217
and decided to approach
McDonald's to make a McWhopper.

00:00:20.217 --> 00:00:22.260
- "Burger King proposed a day of peace."

00:00:22.260 --> 00:00:23.932
I did not know they were at war.

00:00:23.932 --> 00:00:26.091
- "McDonald's quickly rejected the idea

00:00:26.091 --> 00:00:27.821
"by Wednesday morning."

00:00:27.821 --> 00:00:28.878
That's so sad.

00:00:28.878 --> 00:00:30.712
Rejection hurts no matter who you are,

00:00:30.712 --> 00:00:32.394
even if you're the Burger King.

00:00:32.394 --> 00:00:34.474
- I think it's an excellent
idea to mash these things up.

00:00:34.474 --> 00:00:35.460
- So what we're gonna do today is,

00:00:35.460 --> 00:00:37.840
we're gonna take a Big Mac and
we're gonna take a Whopper,

00:00:37.840 --> 00:00:40.138
and we're gonna mush them together,

00:00:40.138 --> 00:00:42.832
make the McWhopper that
we were supposed to have.

00:00:42.832 --> 00:00:44.897
- So you've got your Whopper here,

00:00:44.897 --> 00:00:47.174
which has that perfect charbroiled taste,

00:00:47.174 --> 00:00:49.380
you know, they're famous
for, the grill marks.

00:00:49.380 --> 00:00:50.772
- The ideal thing you wanna do here

00:00:50.772 --> 00:00:53.351
is make sure you don't have
too much bread in one place

00:00:53.351 --> 00:00:54.359
and too much meat in one place.

00:00:54.359 --> 00:00:55.613
You have to get it nice and even.

00:00:55.613 --> 00:00:57.658
- [Voiceover] I'm gonna
keep the middle bun,

00:00:57.658 --> 00:01:00.072
just because that's what
makes a Big Mac a Big Mac.

00:01:00.072 --> 00:01:03.671
- And then you've got this
cute little friend right here.

00:01:03.671 --> 00:01:07.339
- [Voiceover] And we'll take this apart.

00:01:10.279 --> 00:01:11.711
- Okay.

00:01:11.711 --> 00:01:13.604
- (laughs) It's been McWhoppered.

00:01:13.604 --> 00:01:15.972
- I really hope I don't
poop my pants after this.

00:01:15.972 --> 00:01:17.133
- Aw, man.

00:01:17.133 --> 00:01:19.351
Lord Jesus, I'm sorry for
destroying this vessel

00:01:19.351 --> 00:01:21.034
you have created.

00:01:21.034 --> 00:01:22.891
- This is what we could
have had, McDonald's.

00:01:22.891 --> 00:01:23.994
You ruined this for us.

00:01:23.994 --> 00:01:25.932
- Here I go.

00:01:25.932 --> 00:01:27.419
- No.

00:01:30.349 --> 00:01:31.443
- Oh!

00:01:32.435 --> 00:01:33.654
- It's so good.

00:01:33.654 --> 00:01:35.872
- Why isn't this a real thing?

00:01:35.872 --> 00:01:36.974
- Taste's like carbs.

00:01:36.974 --> 00:01:37.716
Love it.

00:01:37.716 --> 00:01:39.040
- Messy but delicious.

00:01:39.040 --> 00:01:40.631
- It's probably a lot
of calories, but hey,

00:01:40.631 --> 00:01:42.477
you're getting double the veggies, so.

00:01:42.477 --> 00:01:45.166
- I think if I was really
drunk I would eat this.

00:01:46.575 --> 00:01:49.125
- If you, like, drop this off
a roof onto a person's head,

00:01:49.125 --> 00:01:51.086
I really actually think
you could do some damage.

00:01:51.086 --> 00:01:52.584
It's like four pounds.

00:01:52.584 --> 00:01:55.596
- This is a win, right here.

